id: pm-rust-okjs
title: "Align local, CI, and release pm tooling for PR 26"
description: Update the local justfile and release contract tests to use the same pm CLI as CI and require complete changelog workspace reads.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-29T04:53:28.447Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-29T05:08:03.539Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-29T05:08:03.117Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-29T05:08:03.117Z"
author: pi-agent
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: "All changelog and CI health invocations pin pm CLI 2026.8.28, request unbounded output budget and limit, and the release pipeline contract and pinned health check pass"
resolution: "Aligned local, CI, and release pm CLI pins and made complete workspace reads contractual."
expected_result: "All local, CI, and release surfaces use pm CLI 2026.8.28 and changelog reads are unbounded and untruncated."
actual_result: The release contract passes and pm 2026.8.28 reports tracker health clean; pm 2026.8.21 reproduced gate-failing drift against origin/main.
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-29T04:53:39.931Z",pi-agent,CI failures came from stale release contract expectations and the local justfile still using pm CLI 2026.8.6. Updated all local/release expectations to 2026.8.21 and complete workspace reads.
  "2026-08-29T04:56:00.792Z",pi-agent,"A strict health run proved 2026.8.21 is too old for the committed tracker: it reports hash and chain drift even on origin/main. Pinning every CI, release, and local surface to 2026.8.28 makes health clean without rewriting history."
  "2026-08-29T05:08:02.699Z",pi-agent,"Final evidence accepted: release-check is green at 100 percent branch coverage and the pinned 2026.8.28 pm health strict gate is clean."
files[4]{path,scope,note}:
  justfile,project,Align local changelog toolchain and complete reads
  tests/release_pipeline_contract.rs,project,Enforce unified pins and complete reads
  .github/workflows/ci.yml,project,Health and merge-driver pin
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project,Release changelog pin and complete reads
tests[2]:
  - command: cargo test --locked --test release_pipeline_contract
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 300
  - command: ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 300
    provenance:
      author: pi-agent
      created_at: "2026-08-29T05:08:02.265Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
